    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O Grady Auctioneers are delighted to present for sale Castleview, a charming three bedroom, two bathroom property located in the peaceful countryside setting of Bunavie, Pallasgreen, Co. Limerick.\n\nThis attractive property enjoys a wonderful elevated position, taking in beautiful views of the surrounding countryside and the picturesque Golden Vale. Offering a peaceful and private setting, Castleview provides an excellent opportunity for those seeking the benefits of country living while remaining within convenient reach of nearby towns and amenities.\n\nThe property offers spacious and versatile accommodation, ideally suited to a range of purchasers, including families and those seeking a comfortable home in a scenic rural location. The surrounding gardens and grounds provide excellent outdoor space, with plenty of potential to enjoy and further enhance the property's attractive setting.\n\nCastleview is conveniently located within reach of everyday amenities and is well positioned for access to Pallasgreen and surrounding areas , including Limerick City, Tipperary Town, Kilmallock and Charleville are also within reasonable commuting distance, offering a wide range of shopping, educational and healthcare facilities.\n\nThe area benefits from good road connections, while Limerick Junction Train Station is also within convenient reach as well as airports such as Shannon which is only a 35 min drive away.This desirable location offers an excellent balance of peaceful countryside living and accessibility."
      },
